  "answer": "**TX-0401 is verified:** EUR 240.00 out, card payment to **TechMart Online** on 2026-07-20, status settled.\n\nFive reason codes can be used for a dispute:\n\n- **duplicate_charge**: you were charged more than once for the same purchase. Your records show a second EUR 240.00 card payment to TechMart Online on 2026-07-14 (TX-0402), so this may be relevant.\n- **fraud_card_not_present**: a card payment was made without your authorization, such as an online transaction you did not make.\n- **unauthorized_debit**: money left your account without your permission.\n- **goods_not_received**: you paid for goods that were never delivered.\n- **service_not_rendered**: you paid for a service that was never provided.\n\nTell me what happened and I can check whether a dispute is eligible under the matching code before anything is filed. I will not open a dispute without your confirmation.",
